            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a vaporizer and an electronic vaporization device. The vaporizer includes a liquid storage housing, a vent tube passing through the liquid storage housing, an airflow channel being formed in the vent tube, and an end cap covering an end of the liquid storage housing. The end cap has a support surface and is provided with a vent hole in communication with the airflow channel. The vaporizer further includes a liquid absorbing member disposed on the support surface. At least one first liquid guide groove is provided on the support surface. The first liquid guide groove has a first end in communication with the vent hole and a second end away from the vent hole.</p>
            </abstract>
